      "answer": "B",
      "reason_rejected": "Revising the hypothesis implies the original was incorrect or incomplete, so it does not lead to the acceptance of the original hypothesis."
    },
    {
      "answer": "C",
      "reason_rejected": "Developing a theory is a later stage in the scientific process that occurs only after a hypothesis has been widely accepted and supported by extensive reproducible evidence."
